            "quote": "Indiscriminate exploitation of resources has led to global ecological crises such as, global warming, ozone layer depletion, environmental pollution and land degradation."
          }
        ],
        "okf_concept_ids": [
          "KC-JESS101-003"
        ]
      }
    ]
